<title>USA: Telscape to buy Network Systems Integration.</title>
<headline>Telscape to buy Network Systems Integration.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telscape International Inc said Monday it has signed a letter of intent to acquire Network Systems Integration SA de CV, located in Mexico City.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Network Systems had sales of about $3.6 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Network Systems provides data and networking products and services.</p>
</text>
